# Eagle's Rescue: "Enchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying" and "{2}{W/U}{W/U}: Return this card from your graveyard to the
# battlefield attached to target creature you control with power 1 or less. Activate only as a sorcery." On turn 3 Bot1 enchants its
# Eager Cadet (1/1, now a 3/3 with flying) and casts a Savannah Lions; Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the Cadet on turn 4 and the Aura
# goes to the graveyard. On turn 5 Bot1 casts a second Cadet and activates the Aura from the graveyard: the Lions (power 2) and Bot2's
# Ornithopter (an opponent's, power 0) are not legal targets (refused); the new Cadet, power exactly 1, is, and the Aura enters
# attached to it without its controller choosing, making it a 3/3 flyer again.

